    narr:narration """This hub tracks the [infrastructure migration decision](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1785405604255_1) from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB, formalized in July 2026. The shift is presented as a [settled technical transition](narr:Narrative_InfrastructureMigrationDecisions) rather than a proposal, characterized by a [defined Q3 2026 timeline](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1785405604255_5). The rationale centers on [quantified performance and cost gains](narr:Narrative_QuantifiedTechnicalJustification), specifically citing a [10x improvement](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1785405604255_4) in analytical query speed alongside reduced licensing overhead. The discourse is marked by a consistent, matter-of-fact register that emphasizes authority and execution, utilizing parallel structural framing to align the decision, the performance targets, and the implementation schedule.""" ;
